4371|# Classes of a provider failure, tried in this order (case-insensitive). permission comes
4372|# first (0.4.0, agy F11: a tool the headless print mode cannot grant was auto-denied and
4373|# the turn produced nothing). capability comes next: "Your token plan does not support
4374|# response_format" is a capability rejection, not a quota one. auth matches whole words
4375|# only ("text authored by" is not auth). transport stays last. Google's wordings (the agy
4376|# engine): RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED -> quota, UNAUTHENTICATED / PERMISSION_DENIED / "not signed
4377|# in" -> auth, INVALID_ARGUMENT / "invalid model selection" -> capability, UNAVAILABLE /
4378|# DEADLINE_EXCEEDED -> transport.
4379|# A usage limit said in WORDS ($script:QuotaTextPattern: usage limit, quota, rate limit, ...)
4380|# is quota even under an auth status, and is tried right before auth: Kimi Code answers "403
4381|# Forbidden: You've reached your 5-hour usage limit..." (live ledger, 2026-09-26), which the
4382|# 403 must not turn into an auth failure - the preflight would refuse that endpoint for 24 h.
4383|$script:QuotaTextPattern = '(?i)usage[ _]limit|quota|rate[ _]limit|resource_exhausted|too many requests'
4384|# (wave 24b) A prompt larger than the context window of the plan or the model is capability, tried
4385|# before auth: Kimi Code answers "401 Unauthorized: Your current plan supports only k3 up to 256K
4386|# context. 1M context is available on higher-tier Kimi Code plans." (live ledger, 2026-09-26) - an
4387|# auth class would refuse that endpoint for 24 h although its credential is fine. Also "maximum
4388|# context length is N tokens", context_length_exceeded, "exceeds the context window", "prompt is
4389|# too long", "input token count ... exceeds the maximum number of tokens". A text that also names
4390|# a usage limit ($script:QuotaTextPattern) stays quota.
4391|$script:ContextOverflowPattern = '(?i)supports?\s+only\b.{0,80}?\b(?:context|tokens?)\b|context[ _-]?(?:length|window)|maximum\s+context|context_length_exceeded|prompt\s+is\s+too\s+long|input\s+(?:is\s+)?too\s+long|input\s+token\s+count|exceeds?\s+the\s+maximum\s+number\s+of\s+tokens'
4392|$script:FailureClassPatterns = [ordered]@{
4393|    'permission' = '(?i)no output produced|auto-denied|permission that headless mode'
4394|    'capability' = '(?i)not supported|unsupported|does(?: not|n[''\u2019]t) support|do not support|feature_not_supported|json_schema|invalid_argument|invalid model selection|conflicts with --effort'
4395|    'auth'       = '(?i)\b40[13]\b|unauthori[sz]ed|forbidden|invalid[ _]api[ _]key|\bauthentication\b|\bauth\b|\bapi key\b|permission_denied|unauthenticated|not signed in|login required|sign in to'
4396|    'quota'      = '(?i)usage[ _]limit|quota|rate[ _]limit|\b429\b|insufficient balance|too many requests|credits? exhausted|credit balance|payment required|\b402\b|token plan|plan exhausted|billing|resource_exhausted|rate_limit_exceeded'
4397|    'transport'  = '(?i)timeout|timed out|connection|econn|enotfound|\bdns\b|\btls\b|certificate|\b50[234]\b|network|\bunavailable\b|deadline_exceeded'
4398|}
